{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12243010","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12243010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1224301001:1":{"text":"What a coincidence! I was just about to send Bella to you.","source_cn":"够巧的，我正准备让贝拉去找你。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x75BEDA45AB2B61E4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What a coincidence! I was just about to send Bella to you.","female":"What a coincidence! I was just about to send Bella to you.","variant_male_record_index":"140821","variant_female_record_index":"140822","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1224301002:0":{"text":"Heh, we've been checking on the docks every day. Looks like the repairs will be done today!","source_cn":"嘿嘿，我们一直算着修码头的时间呢，已经猜到今天差不多要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A115148931452D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224301003:1":{"text":"You're right—we're indeed wrapping things up.","source_cn":"不错，码头那边已经在收尾了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23CF288DDCC565B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224301004:0":{"text":"We're getting the ships repaired next, and we need the help of professionals. That frivolous kid and his nannies are experts in this.","source_cn":"接下来的问题就是船只，得有专人维护它们。在这方面，那个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF85CCCD3BDDCB05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1224301004":{"text":"We're getting the ships repaired next, and we need the help of professionals. That frivolous kid and his nannies are experts in this.","source_cn":"接下来的问题就是船只，得有专人维护它们。在这方面，那个轻浮小子和他的妈妈们是熟手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF85CCCD3BDDCB05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224301005:0":{"text":"He means Sinbad.","source_cn":"二当家说的是辛巴达。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x14B3B602436A2DA5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"He means Sinbad.","female":"He means Sinbad.","variant_male_record_index":"140826","variant_female_record_index":"140827","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1224301007:1":{"text":"There are few shipwrights left in Rustport as many have been hired by the caravans. The villagers of Brineville are the only people who can help us.","source_cn":"锈锚港的船匠有限，很多还被商队请去修船了。能帮上我们的...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF7EB3B4C1DF0032A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"There are few shipwrights left in Rustport as many have been hired by the caravans. The villagers of Brineville are the only people who can help us.","female":"There are few shipwrights left in Rustport as many have been hired by the caravans. The villagers of Brineville are the only people who can help us.","variant_male_record_index":"140830","variant_female_record_index":"140831","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1224301008:1":{"text":"Yet, it isn't a good idea for us to visit them. They hate us, after all.","source_cn":"但是，血薇帮不方便直接去小水村。她们讨厌我们。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1BCCB245287ED4F9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yet, it isn't a good idea for us to visit them. They hate us, after all.","female":"Yet, it isn't a good idea for us to visit them. They hate us, after all.","variant_male_record_index":"140832","variant_female_record_index":"140833","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1224301009:1":{"text":"We'll get beaten up there.","source_cn":"我们去，会被打。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x18596A575FAE8AC2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We'll get beaten up there.","female":"We'll get beaten up there.","variant_male_record_index":"140834","variant_female_record_index":"140835","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1224301009":{"text":"We'll get beaten up there.","source_cn":"我们去，会被打。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x18596A575FAE8AC2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We'll get beaten up there.","female":"We'll get beaten up there.","variant_male_record_index":"140834","variant_female_record_index":"140835","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1224301010:1":{"text":"It isn't that bad...","source_cn":"应该不至于吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA36282C4A08BA90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1224301011:0":{"text":"We will before Tesio's trial, but maybe not afterward.","source_cn":"在审判泰西欧之前，一定会。审判之后，或许不会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF16D2C739ECE1C","variant_statu